# Copy to `.secrets` (gitignored) only if you use Turbo remote caching locally.
# act auto-loads `.secrets` from the repo root if it exists.
#
# Local act runs work fine WITHOUT this file: turbo simply skips the remote
# cache and builds from the local cache. The other CI env values seen in
# ci.yml (ENCRYPTION_KEY, CSRF_SECRET, TURNSTILE_*) are throwaway literals
# set inline per step, not secrets, so they do not belong here.
#
# TURBO_TEAM is a repository variable, not a secret. If you want it locally,
# put `TURBO_TEAM=your-team` in a `.vars` file (also gitignored, auto-loaded).
TURBO_TOKEN=
